1
00:00:00,505 --> 00:00:04,185
(Sheldon:)When Obi-Wan came to Luke
on this very spot,

2
00:00:04,342 --> 00:00:07,052
(Sheldon:)he gave him all sorts
of helpful advice.

3
00:00:07,212 --> 00:00:09,022
(Sheldon:)So, um...

4
00:00:10,215 --> 00:00:12,385
(Sheldon:)...what do you got for me?

5
00:00:13,852 --> 00:00:14,832
(Leonard:)Um...

6
00:00:16,354 --> 00:00:18,394
(Raj:)Always...

7
00:00:18,523 --> 00:00:21,133
(Arthur:)...get... get a prenup.

8
00:00:24,529 --> 00:00:26,669
(Sheldon:)That's it?

9
00:00:26,731 --> 00:00:29,901
(Sheldon:)I thought there'd be more
of a reason why you're here.

10
00:00:30,068 --> 00:00:33,538
Well, why do you think I'm here?

11
00:00:33,671 --> 00:00:37,141
(Sheldon:)I suppose it has something to do
with your recent passing.

12
00:00:37,308 --> 00:00:41,048
(Arthur:)Is this the... the first time
you've lost, you know,

13
00:00:41,212 --> 00:00:42,592
(Arthur:)someone close to you?

14
00:00:42,747 --> 00:00:45,087
(Sheldon:)Oh, no. No.

15
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:49,360
(Sheldon:)I've already had to say good-bye
to 11 Dr. Whos.

16
00:00:51,256 --> 00:00:57,026
(Arthur:)Yeah, I've... I've outlived
a few of my doctors, too.

